 "hero_names": {
  "_doc": "A race's hero name: every pick by src/rng.gd seeded from FNV-1a(race key + '|hero|' + signature id), each hero its own draw, from lists in file order (signatures sorted by id), so every peer names it the same and a reroll renames it. The name: the creature's list and the culture's together. The epithet or nickname: the signature's own, so the name matches the look (the Gnawer wears the gnawed crown). The title: the signature's titles if it has them, else the creature's and culture's (kept neutral). The format: one of the signature's formats. A mod adds a creature or culture by adding its lists here, a hero by adding a signature.",
